The  driver  provides  support for the AIC‐6260 and AIC‐6360 con‐
troller chips.  The PCMCIA host adapters and many  ISA  cards  do
not include boot ROMs and therefore cannot be used to connect the
boot  device.   Cards  supported  by the driver include: 1502 ISA
SCSI host adaptor 152x ISA SCSI  host  adaptor  AHA‐1520B  ISAPNP
SCSI  host adaptor APA‐1460 PCMCIA SCSI host adaptor SoundBlaster
ISA SCSI host adaptor, and compatibles
